## 📊 Updated Red Flag Summary

| Red Flag | Trigger Condition | Penalty |
|----------|-------------------|---------|
| Resume cramming | 70%+ repos in last 30 days | -5 |
| Self-starred forks | User starred own forks | -5 |
| No .gitignore | 60%+ repos missing .gitignore | -3 |
| Lazy commits | 40%+ messages are "update"/"fix" | -5 |
| Tutorial clone | README similarity > 0.85 | -10 |
| Structure clone | File tree matches known tutorial | -10 |
| Low uniqueness | Uniqueness score < 0.4 | -8 |
| Commit dump | Concentrated commits + low quality | -5 |

**Maximum new penalties**: -51 points (combined with existing flags)

